## Manejo de errores con `on_error` y `on_not_found`, como `error` de Express.
import std.spark
import portus

## Falla a propósito con un 400.
weave boom with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    return calling portus.err_void with (calling portus.bad_request with "algo salió mal")

## Responde a las rutas que no existen.
weave missing with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    calling context.send_status with 404, "no existe esa ruta"
    return calling portus.ok_void

## Formatea cualquier error no manejado, conservando su código.
weave handle_error with context as ref to portus.Context, failure as portus.HttpError into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    calling context.send_status with (calling portus.status_of with failure), "error controlado"
    return calling portus.ok_void

weave main into int:
    var app as portus.Application is calling portus.new_application
    let added as result of void to portus.PatternError is calling portus.get with sigil of app, "/boom", boom
    calling portus.on_not_found with sigil of app, missing
    calling portus.on_error with sigil of app, handle_error
    calling spark.println with "portus escuchando en http://127.0.0.1:3000"
    let served as result of int to string is calling portus.serve with sigil of app, 3000
    let bound as int is served or:
        return 1
    return 0
